,"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","ts":"1791987000.000124"}}
{"seq":18,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-2026-11/zero-min-opus-none-mu-v03-dev2/sy-01-quarrendon-ticket-numbers/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T08:00:33.842Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"4f22a4ad06daee22f62859b9e4af5007b2451fc5310eae5858768d66d6fb67f8","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","text":"I found two Quarrendon Freight Lines ticket numbers in Moss's notes, and I've sent you the full list in our DM:\n\n1. **#PD-4492**, from \"Moss: Sunday prep for Ruth\" (5 Oct 2025, in the North team digests). Thea Ramaswell opened it on 4 Oct 2025 because drivers checking in by tablet at the Eau Claire yard weren't getting text messages with their bay assignments. It affected Dock Doors 14–18 on the 04:00 shift. Support patched it that evening, and Thea confirmed the next morning's shift got through the gate cleanly.\n2. **#4419**, from \"Moss: North cheat sheet\" (no date, also in the North team digests). Thea logged it because the gatehouse barcode scanners weren't reading trailer tags at Door 14 on third shift. It was escalated to tier-2 product support to test the scanner software.\n\nWhat I left out:\n- **Marrow tickets:** #4409, #4412 and FR-882 in Moss's Central handoffs note are for the two Marrow accounts, not Quarrendon Freight Lines.\n- **No ticket numbers:** Two other Moss notes mention Quarrendon Freight Lines, the 14 Sept 2025 pipeline digest and the 23 Mar 2026 renewal check-in. Neither has a ticket number.\n- **Different company:** Marcus's note on \"Quarendon Freightways\" is about a company that isn't a customer, and it isn't one of Moss's notes.\n\nI only checked notes and channels you can see yourself. If Moss wrote about this account anywhere else, it isn't in this list. Quarrendon Freight Lines is a North account, so it's worth asking Ilse or Dana whether they have more tickets before the QBR deck goes out."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","ts":"1791